					<description><![CDATA[<p>Cardboard sushi boxes help restaurants, cloud kitchens, and delivery brands keep sushi rolls stable, fresh, and neatly arranged during transport. In the second line, many sellers choose <strong data-start="1991" data-end="2050">Shop Cardboard Boxes</strong> to get printed sushi boxes that match their fast food and Japanese cuisine packaging themes.</p>
